<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS1.SSS3" title="In D.1 Surface Features (16 Features) ‣ Appendix D Feature Documentation ‣ RADAR: Mechanistic Pathways for Detecting Data Contamination in LLM Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.1.3 </span>Information-Theoretic Features (4 Features)</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SS2" title="In Appendix D Feature Documentation ‣ RADAR: Mechanistic Pathways for Detecting Data Contamination in LLM Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2 </span>Mechanistic Features (21 Features)</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS1" title="In D.2 Mechanistic Features (21 Features) ‣ Appendix D Feature Documentation ‣ RADAR: Mechanistic Pathways for Detecting Data Contamination in LLM Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2.1 </span>Attention Specialization Features (5 Features)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS2" title="In D.2 Mechanistic Features (21 Features) ‣ Appendix D Feature Documentation ‣ RADAR: Mechanistic Pathways for Detecting Data Contamination in LLM Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2.2 </span>Circuit Dynamics Features (4 Features)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS3" title="In D.2 Mechanistic Features (21 Features) ‣ Appendix D Feature Documentation ‣ RADAR: Mechanistic Pathways for Detecting Data Contamination in LLM Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2.3 </span>Intervention Sensitivity Features (4 Features)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS4" title="In D.2 Mechanistic Features (21 Features) ‣ Appendix D Feature Documentation ‣ RADAR: Mechanistic Pathways for Detecting Data Contamination in LLM Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2.4 </span>Working Memory Features (4 Features)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS5" title="In D.2 Mechanistic Features (21 Features) ‣ Appendix D Feature Documentation ‣ RADAR: Mechanistic Pathways for Detecting Data Contamination in LLM Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2.5 </span>Causal Effect Features (4 Features)</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
