</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A2.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">This dataset provides the classifier with a basic representation of the internal features and patterns that distinguish factual retrieval from logical inference. Representative examples are shown below:</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Sample training dataset prompts and labels.</figcaption>
