<span id="A2.T3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T3.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">“The capital of France is”</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.T3.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T3.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">recall</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T3.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T3.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T3.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">“If X is the capital of France, then X is”</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T3.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T3.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">reasoning</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T3.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T3.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T3.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">“2 + 2 equals”</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T3.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T3.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">recall</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T3.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A2.T3.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:207.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T3.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">“If a triangle has angles 60, 60, and X degrees, then X equals”</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
<span id="A2.T3.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:69.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T3.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">reasoning</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Test Dataset</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The test dataset was used only for evaluating the trained classifier on unseen data. It comprises 100 examples, with broader coverage to assess generalization across different levels of difficulty and ambiguity:</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Composition of the test dataset.</figcaption>
