</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="A2.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The inclusion of challenging and complex reasoning cases is important for evaluating robustness, especially in detecting possible data contamination where a reasoning task could be solved by recall.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Examples from each category are shown below:</p>
</div>
